SUMMARY:NLGJA-DC Pride Happy Hour
DESCRIPTION:Join our DC Chapter for their biggest event of the year — their annual Pride Happy Hour! Come to Trade for an afternoon of celebration\, networking and fun with your fellow queer media professionals. \n\nRSVP here!
URL:https://www.nlgja.org/event/nlgja-dc-pride-happy-hour/
LOCATION:Trade\, 1410 14th Street Northwest\, Washington\, DC\, 20009\, United States
CATEGORIES:Chapters
END:VEVENT
